 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. MORTGAGE-CALC.

*> Computes monthly mortgage payment using the standard
*> annuity formula:
*>   M = P * r * (1+r)^n / ((1+r)^n - 1)
*> where r = monthly rate (annual / 12 / 100), n = months.

 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 PRINCIPAL    PIC 9(7).
 01 ANNUAL-RATE  PIC 9(2)V99.
 01 YEARS        PIC 9(2).
 01 MONTHLY-RATE PIC 9V9(8).
 01 PAYMENTS     PIC 9(4).
 01 FACTOR       PIC 9(8)V9(4).
 01 PAYMENT      PIC 9(7)V99.

 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
 MAIN.
     DISPLAY "MORTGAGE CALCULATOR".
     DISPLAY "ENTER PRINCIPAL ($): " WITH NO ADVANCING.
     ACCEPT PRINCIPAL.
     DISPLAY "ENTER ANNUAL RATE (% e.g. 6.5): " WITH NO ADVANCING.
     ACCEPT ANNUAL-RATE.
     DISPLAY "ENTER TERM (YEARS): " WITH NO ADVANCING.
     ACCEPT YEARS.

     COMPUTE MONTHLY-RATE = ANNUAL-RATE / 12 / 100.
     COMPUTE PAYMENTS     = YEARS * 12.
     COMPUTE FACTOR       = (1 + MONTHLY-RATE) ** PAYMENTS.
     COMPUTE PAYMENT      = PRINCIPAL * MONTHLY-RATE * FACTOR / (FACTOR - 1).

     DISPLAY "MONTHLY PAYMENT: $" PAYMENT.
     STOP RUN.
